/TRAP PROCESSOR SUBROUTINES
/ILLEGAL CHAR, GET ANOTHER
KERR,	CLR
	STC KSTF
/KBDA - OPR 13. ASCII INPUT COMMAND (8-BIT)
IKBDA,	STC CASE
/KBD - OPR 15
IKBD,	ADD KSTF
	AZE
	JMP KBDT
	ADD LINS
	ROR I 5	/WAIT BIT ON?/
	STC 0	/CLEAR THE AC
	LZE
	JMP IKBD	/LOOP UNTIL  CHAR IN
	JMP KBDX	/IMMEDIATE EXIT
/TYP - OPR 14
