/
/
/THE FOLLOWING CODE IS PAGED IN WITH
/RESIDENT INDEX.  STATE 7 ENTRY
/WILL ASSURE THAT IT IS IN PLACE
/ALONG WITH INDEX.  
/
/CONTAINED IS CODE FOR OPR 5 (IRETV),
/OPR 6 (INDM), AND OPR 7 (IEDM).  THESE 
/ARE ONLY CALLED FROM DEMO PROGRAMS.
	*1720
/RETRIEVE INDEX ENTRY
/
/CALL:  OPR 5
/       PARAMADDR
/       (ALL RETURNS)
/
/       PARAMADDR,  TEXT "FULLPNAM"
/                   5757
/                    5757
/                  5757
/                  5757
/
/LAST 4 WORDS WILL BE REPLACED
/WITH SIGNIFICANT INFO IF
/SEARCH IS SUCCESSFUL
/
IRETV,	ADD   LINS+1
	ADD   M1
	BSE I
	2000
	STC   12
	SET I 11
	-4
	SET I 10
	ZPNAME-1
	ADD   IT1	/AN APPROPRIATE FIELD INSTRUCTION
	STA
	.+2
	STC   RRTX+1
LOOP,	LDF
	LDA I 12	/MOVE PC+1,+2,+3,+4
	LDF 1
	STA I 10	/TO ZPNAME,+1,+2,+3
	XSK I 11
	JMP   LOOP
